    "title": "Community invited to 'Roosevelt & Rhythm' | Preston County News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "ARTHURDALE, W.Va. (WV News) — The community is invited to the upcoming “Roosevelt & Rhythm” event, an evening full of history, music and the Appalachian tradition of storytelling, hosted by Arthurdale Heritage Inc.\nCurator and Director of Education Elizabeth Satterfield said Arthurdale is busier than ever, gearing up for a packed fall schedule. One of the major highlights of the season is “Roosevelt & Rhythm,” featuring Franklin D. Roosevelt impersonator Gary Stamm and West Virginia musicians and storytellers Chris Haddox and Aristotle Jones.",
